// The external `.wasm` behind `spec_linked_extern.inf`, compiled on its own and
// merged into it. It is deliberately trivial: the fixture pair exists to cover
// the link and the obligation that names the merged body, not this arithmetic.
//
// It carries no `spec` of its own and no data segment — the corpus rejects a
// data segment in any module it gates, and the failure would be reported against
// the main fixture's name rather than this one.

pub fn double(a: i32) -> i32 {
  return a + a;
}
